    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or up to 4 players online. Open your own Bakery caf\u00e9 and grow your business by serving your customers the delicious dishes you make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444080/extras/62cb1f27500c412cdc6e7b0bf12cbaa1.poster.avif?t=1751976108\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444080/extras/62cb1f27500c412cdc6e7b0bf12cbaa1.webm?t=1751976108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444080/extras/62cb1f27500c412cdc6e7b0bf12cbaa1.mp4?t=1751976108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and furnish your caf\u00e9 according to your desires. Place tables for customers, decorate and organize your kitchen to be productive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444080/extras/e59e8ec2729a9fdeaa6951bd622aadaf.poster.avif?t=1751976108\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444080/extras/e59e8ec2729a9fdeaa6951bd622aadaf.webm?t=1751976108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444080/extras/e59e8ec2729a9fdeaa6951bd622aadaf.mp4?t=1751976108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your orders for raw materials so you always have something to offer your customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444080/extras/e204bc77307d57d9f7a3f20ae6be1d0e.poster.avif?t=1751976108\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444080/extras/e204bc77307d57d9f7a3f20ae6be1d0e.webm?t=1751976108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444080/extras/e204bc77307d57d9f7a3f20ae6be1d0e.mp4?t=1751976108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a varied and demanding culinary experience. Be careful not to keep customers waiting, they could become unhappy.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or up to 4 players online. Open your own Bakery caf\u00e9 and grow your business by serving your customers the delicious dishes you make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444080/extras/62cb1f27500c412cdc6e7b0bf12cbaa1.poster.avif?t=1751976108\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444080/extras/62cb1f27500c412cdc6e7b0bf12cbaa1.webm?t=1751976108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444080/extras/62cb1f27500c412cdc6e7b0bf12cbaa1.mp4?t=1751976108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and furnish your caf\u00e9 according to your desires. Place tables for customers, decorate and organize your kitchen to be productive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444080/extras/e59e8ec2729a9fdeaa6951bd622aadaf.poster.avif?t=1751976108\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444080/extras/e59e8ec2729a9fdeaa6951bd622aadaf.webm?t=1751976108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444080/extras/e59e8ec2729a9fdeaa6951bd622aadaf.mp4?t=1751976108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your orders for raw materials so you always have something to offer your customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444080/extras/e204bc77307d57d9f7a3f20ae6be1d0e.poster.avif?t=1751976108\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444080/extras/e204bc77307d57d9f7a3f20ae6be1d0e.webm?t=1751976108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444080/extras/e204bc77307d57d9f7a3f20ae6be1d0e.mp4?t=1751976108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a varied and demanding culinary experience. Be careful not to keep customers waiting, they could become unhappy.</p>",
